('hq-0037-1','math','高中',13,'hs-kp-0037','single_choice',0.55,'y=f(x) 纵坐标伸长为 4 倍 → ?','[{"key":"A","text":"y=4f(x)"},{"key":"B","text":"y=f(4x)"},{"key":"C","text":"y=f(x)/4"},{"key":"D","text":"y=f(x+4)"}]','A','纵伸改变函数值：y=4f(x)','template-hs','approved','通用');
