('hq-0039-1','math','高中',13,'hs-kp-0039','single_choice',0.75,'f(x)=4x²+1 是？','[{"key":"A","text":"偶函数"},{"key":"B","text":"奇函数"},{"key":"C","text":"非奇非偶"},{"key":"D","text":"既是奇又是偶"}]','A','f(-x)=4x²+1=f(x) → 偶函数','template-hs','approved','通用');
